  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b7f5be794788a86acd2c2c7c7a97c1347686e1ce807c6c29a7f28dcde0668976.png] \n\nThe given equation is: **15 - 3 + 40 ÷ 5 × 30 = 23**\n\nNow, let's check each option,\n\n1) **÷ and -**\n\n→ **15 ÷ 3** + 40 - 5 × 30 = 23\n\n→ 5 + 40 - **5 × 30** = 23\n\n→ **5 ****+ 40** - 150 = 23\n\n→ 45 - 150 = 23\n\n→ - 105 ≠ 23\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n2) **+ and -**\n\n→ 15 + 3 - **40 ÷ 5** × 30 = 23\n\n→ 15 + 3 - **8 × 30** = 23\n\n→ **15 +**** 3** - 240 = 23\n\n→ 18 - 240 = 23\n\n→ - 222 ≠ 23\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n3) **+ and ÷**\n\n→ 15 - **3 ÷ 40** + 5 × 30 = 23\n\n→ 15 - 3/40 + **5 × 30** = 23\n\n→ **15** - 3/40 **+ 150** = 23\n\n→ 165 - 3/40 ≠ 23\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n4) **- and ×**\n\n→ 15 × 3 + **40 ÷ 5** - 30 = 23\n\n→ **15 ****× 3** + 8 - 30 = 23\n\n→ **45 + 8** - 30 = 23\n\n→ 53 - 30 = 23\n\n→ 23 = 23\n\n→ **LHS = RHS** ⇒ **Justifies the equation.**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"- and ×\"**.",
